7
# type interaction, parameters (epsilon/kB [K], sigma [A])
Al             lennard-jones   254.126    4.0082      // UFF, Rappe et al., JACS 1992, 114, 10024 (D=0.505 kcal/mol, x=4.499 A)
O              lennard-jones    30.193    3.1181      // UFF (D=0.060, x=3.500)
C              lennard-jones    52.838    3.4309      // UFF (D=0.105, x=3.851)
H              lennard-jones    22.142    2.5711      // UFF (D=0.044, x=2.886)
C_co2          lennard-jones    27.0      2.80        // TraPPE, Potoff & Siepmann, AIChE J. 2001, 47, 1676
O_co2          lennard-jones    79.0      3.05        // TraPPE
He             lennard-jones    10.9      2.64        // helium probe for the void fraction (standard RASPA value)
# general mixing rule for Lennard-Jones
Lorentz-Berthelot
